  "effectiveDate": "2023-07-19",
  "historyNote": "#5638, eff 9-1-93; ss by #6762, eff 7-1-98; ss by #7153, eff 12-10-99; amd by #7874-A, eff 4-18-03; ss by #8986, eff 9-24-07; ss by #10624, eff 6-26-14; ss by #13687, eff 7-19-23",
